Package: cprd.search
Title: Search the Clinical Practice Research Datalink Aurum Dictionary
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R:
    person("Ramin", "Rezaeianzadeh", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "ramin.rezaeianzadeh@outlook.com")
Description: Searches user-supplied Clinical Practice Research Datalink (CPRD)
    Aurum medical dictionaries to support the development of medical code lists.
    Provides case-insensitive keyword searches with AND, OR, and exclusion logic,
    optional regular expressions, approximate matching of complete terms,
    observation-count filtering, column selection, and deduplicated combinations
    of results. Exports results to comma-separated files while preserving
    character identifiers. Includes synthetic example data; real dictionaries
    must be obtained separately from CPRD <https://www.cprd.com/>.
